% $$f(x)=(x^q +x+\delta)^{3q+2} +ax$$is a permutation polynomial of $\mathbb{F}_{q^2}$ if and only if $Tr(\delta)=0$, or $Tr(\delta)^2+a=0$.\end{thm}
