+        "Track B: exhaustive inversion after the paper's coordinate reduction "
+        "scans O(layers*p) base-field values; at the initial hard preset the "
+        "measured reference cost is recorded by selftest, while the structural "
+        "route uses O(layers*log p) exact operations and remains below 300."
